        264.68,
        486.74,
        306.86,
        164.45,
        306.86
      ],
      "text": "(1) The appointment of Shri R.R.Diwakar, Member of the Constituent Assembly, as Minister of State for Information and Broadcasting with effect from the 7th December, 1948."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        164.45,
        311.82,
        533.85,
