        355.66,
        164.45,
        355.66
      ],
      "text": "(2) The appointment of Dr.Balkrishan V.Keskar, Member of the Constituent Assembly, as Deputy Minister with effect from the 7th December, 1948. He will be attached to the Ministry of External Affairs & Commonwealth Relations."
